{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會續會討論把握國家航天發展及北都大學城機遇／黃錦輝認酒駕判刑\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261126.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會今日(11月26日)續會，討論議員議案，把握國家航天發展及北都大學城機遇，助力香港航天科技。另外，前立法會議員黃錦輝承認酒後駕駛等罪，今日判刑。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.169233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T23:26:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T00:31:00.001228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T23:51:06.939177+00:00","content_hash":"f6c6ff4904c091a3afe98df775efd2f9183deac91e06525ca9ce789b3ca240ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.169233+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}